---
source: misc/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"look\")"
---
Display lines beginning with a given string

Usage: look [OPTIONS] <STRING> [FILE]

Arguments:
  <STRING>  String to search for
  [FILE]    File to search (default: /usr/share/dict/words)

Options:
  -a, --alternative            Use the alternative dictionary file
  -d, --alphanum               Use normal dictionary character set and order (only blanks and
                               alphanumeric characters are compared)
  -f, --ignore-case            Ignore the case of alphabetic characters
  -t, --terminate <TERMINATE>  String termination character
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
